DTSTAMP:20261016T121959Z
DTSTART:20261027T190000Z
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261028
SUMMARY:The Phantom of the Opera – Silent Film Night
DESCRIPTION:A 1925 silent Phantom of the Opera screening with a real-time
  live organ score. Doors open early for guests to enjoy the church's arc
 hitecture beforehand.\nPrice: Tickets are priced from £12.50 for conces
 sions and £15 for general admission\, and must be reserved in advance.\
 nhttps://onecitylondon.com/article/things-to-do-this-june-in-the-city-of
 -london/
LOCATION:St Lawrence Jewry\, Guildhall Yard\, London\, EC2V 5AA\, London
URL:https://onecitylondon.com/article/things-to-do-this-june-in-the-city-
 of-london/
END:VEVENT
